intent:
You are a cycle-5 production auditor for https://awesome.video, on slice ux-public-core, **run C**, signed out. You cover the second half of what run A left.

Read these first:
- /Users/nick/Desktop/awesome-list-site/reports/prod-audit-2026-10-26/cycle-05/BRIEF.md, completely. It sets the start gate (revision 63a1c79dbc99bfa6edf2c43d56510dddd36da313), tools, widths, hard rules and output format.
- reports/prod-audit-2026-10-26/cycle-05/ux-public-core/findings.md, run A's result. Don't repeat it.

## Your scope (run C)
Finish all of it in this run. Do not stop early or ask whether to continue. If time runs short, complete fewer items fully and list the rest as UNVERIFIED.

1. **Route focus and scroll matrix (#88 PG-08 changed this).** Run each case at 1440 and at 390 touch:
   - a link click;
   - keyboard Tab+Enter;
   - Back after scrolling deep;
   - Forward;
   - a #fragment link on first load: /tag/hls#related-topics-heading;
   - fragment, then another page, then Back;
   - a bogus fragment;
   - a first load without a fragment.

   For each, record scrollY, the activeElement, whether it is in view, and whether a focus ring shows. Expected: a keyboard action gives a ring, a pointer action gives none, and the focused element is always in view or focus stays on BODY.
2. **Error and offline pages (#90 PS-22).** Use emulate Offline on a category route, then go offline, navigate in the app, press Retry while offline, and reconnect. It should recover with no click. Run it 3 times. Also check the 404 page. PS-26 (an app-level first-load failure) is known and in flight, so don't re-file it.
3. **Rail at 1250×720 and 1200×700.** Is it sticky? Can you reach both the first and the last rail link ("Submit a resource") by scrolling? If resize_page doesn't override emulation, use emulate viewport instead.
4. **Full target-size sweeps on / and on a category page at 1440 and at 820 touch.** Include the header and the footer.
5. **Reduced motion** (emulate prefersReducedMotion reduce) on / and a category page: no running animations, and scroll-behavior is auto.

Use chrome-devtools MCP with isolatedContext "c5-pubcore-c". Save evidence under reports/prod-audit-2026-10-26/cycle-05/ux-public-core/runC-*. In your final message, return the full findings.md content: a findings table, a status for each item, then Passed and UNVERIFIED. Never use pkill or killall.

